WEBVTT

00:06:28.817 --> 00:06:32.341
Kada sam postala "istraživač ranjivosti"

00:06:32.365 --> 00:06:35.100
to je dospelo u žižu javnosti
zbog mog TED govora,

00:06:35.124 --> 00:06:36.521
ne šalim se.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.108
Daću vam jedan primer:

00:06:39.132 --> 00:06:42.045
Pre oko tri meseca,
bila sam u jednoj sportskoj radnji,

00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:43.498
kupovala naočare i štitnike,

00:06:43.522 --> 00:06:47.097
i sve ono što roditelji kupuju
u sportskim radnjama.

00:06:47.121 --> 00:06:49.970
Na oko trideset metara od mene
čujem ovo:

00:06:49.994 --> 00:06:52.625
"Ranjiva TED! Ranjiva TED!"

00:06:52.649 --> 00:06:54.505
(Smeh)

00:06:58.545 --> 00:06:59.546
(Smeh se završava)

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:02.645
Ja pripadam petoj generaciji Teksašana.